    "detailed_description": "Step in the shoes of Tabu the sultan with his magical bouncy sword and overcome various traps and challenges. With practice you'll be able to jump, swing, climb and reach new places. Finishing this game won't be easy! Do you think you have it in you to go all the way? <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950530/extras/23de48a48a28cab60184346d5c91e512.poster.avif?t=1718355186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950530/extras/23de48a48a28cab60184346d5c91e512.webm?t=1718355186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950530/extras/23de48a48a28cab60184346d5c91e512.mp4?t=1718355186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Test Your Skills!<br></li><li> Feel new types of frustration, anger and euphoria you didn't know you were capable of.<br></li><li> Become better with each attempt!<br></li><li> Become the best sultan in the leaderboards!<br></li><li> This game has no save option! Finish or die trying.<br></li><li> 4 game modes, each more challenging!<br></li><li> Beautiful scenery.<br></li><li> Full of different type of traps to challenge you.<br></li><li> Challenge yourself by finishing the game in one go. </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discord</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "Step in the shoes of Tabu the sultan with his magical bouncy sword and overcome various traps and challenges. With practice you'll be able to jump, swing, climb and reach new places. Finishing this game won't be easy! Do you think you have it in you to go all the way? <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950530/extras/23de48a48a28cab60184346d5c91e512.poster.avif?t=1718355186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950530/extras/23de48a48a28cab60184346d5c91e512.webm?t=1718355186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950530/extras/23de48a48a28cab60184346d5c91e512.mp4?t=1718355186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Test Your Skills!<br></li><li> Feel new types of frustration, anger and euphoria you didn't know you were capable of.<br></li><li> Become better with each attempt!<br></li><li> Become the best sultan in the leaderboards!<br></li><li> This game has no save option! Finish or die trying.<br></li><li> 4 game modes, each more challenging!<br></li><li> Beautiful scenery.<br></li><li> Full of different type of traps to challenge you.<br></li><li> Challenge yourself by finishing the game in one go. </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discord</h2>",
